# Kept out of the public asset upload.
#
# Astro's Cloudflare adapter writes the server bundle to dist/_worker.js and its
# routing hints to dist/_routes.json. Both are build output, not site content —
# uploading _worker.js as a static asset would publish the server-side code to
# the open internet. Wrangler refuses the deploy without this file.
#
# This lives in public/ so Astro copies it to dist/ on every build; a file
# written directly into dist/ would be lost on the next build.
_worker.js
_routes.json
